The fees below apply from the Effective Date until amended under {{ref: scope-changes}}.

| Service tier | Monthly volume | Unit price |
|---|---|---:|
| Standard | 0 – 1,000 units | {{money: 0.50, currency=USD}} |
| Professional | 1,001 – 5,000 units | {{money: 0.40, currency=USD}} |
| Enterprise | 5,000+ units | {{money: 0.30, currency=USD}} |

## Professional Services {#pricing-professional-services}

Development work outside the agreed backlog is charged at
{{money: 185, currency=USD, note=Blended hourly rate}} per hour, estimated in advance and invoiced
monthly in arrears.

<!-- This heading carries no explicit {#id}: its identifier is auto-generated per §5.3,
     producing `currency-and-taxes`. -->

## Currency and Taxes

All amounts are stated exclusive of value added tax, which is charged in addition at the rate
applicable on the invoice date.

## Annual Review {#pricing-review}

The parties shall review pricing annually. Any increase takes effect no earlier than
{{duration: 12, unit=MO}} after the Effective Date and shall not exceed
{{placeholder: annual-increase-cap, note=Cap negotiated per Client}}.
